{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-network-basics","title":"工业网络基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols/industrial-network-basics","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"工业网络基础\">工业网络基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>要理解工业网络，先得放下我们对家用网络的直觉。在家里，网页慢一秒、视频卡一下，顶多让人皱皱眉；但在工厂里，控制信号晚到几毫秒可能就是废品甚至事故。这种对&quot;准时&quot;的极致要求，是工业网络一切设计的出发点。</p>\n<p>本节要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工业网络的核心追求是确定性（Determinism）：数据必须在可预测、有上限的时间内送达。</li>\n<li>三个关键指标：实时性（延迟低）、可靠性（不丢包）、确定性（延迟有保证）。</li>\n<li>工业网络通常分层组织，常见的是&quot;现场层—控制层—企业层&quot;的金字塔结构。</li>\n<li>普通以太网&quot;尽力而为&quot;的特性不能直接满足工业需求，于是衍生出工业以太网与各种总线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>我们先把&quot;确定性&quot;这个最容易混淆的概念讲清楚。很多人以为&quot;实时&quot;就是&quot;快&quot;，其实不完全对。在工业语境里，&quot;实时&quot;更强调&quot;准时&quot;——哪怕慢一点，但每次都稳定地在规定时间内完成，比偶尔很快、偶尔很慢更重要。</p>\n<p>打个比方：你坐地铁通勤，A 线路平均 20 分钟到、但偶尔堵 40 分钟；B 线路稳定 25 分钟、误差从不超过 1 分钟。对赶时间的上班族来说，可预测的 B 线路反而更靠谱。工业网络要的就是 B 线路这种&quot;确定性&quot;。</p>\n<p>我们用三个指标来衡量工业网络的好坏：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实时性：从数据发出到收到的延迟，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，工业控制常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d &lt; 10\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，高端运动控制甚至要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d &lt; 1\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>可靠性：在恶劣的车间电磁环境下也不丢包、不出错。</li>\n<li>确定性：延迟的抖动（Jitter）要小，即每次延迟都接近，可用抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = t_{\\max} - t_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来衡量，越小越好。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为什么普通以太网不够用？因为标准以太网是&quot;尽力而为（Best Effort）&quot;的：多个设备同时抢着发数据时会冲突、要重发，延迟变得不可预测。这对刷网页没问题，对工业控制就是灾难。所以工程师们发明了各种工业以太网和现场总线来&quot;驯服&quot;这种不确定性，这是下一节的主题。</p>\n<p>工业网络通常按职责分层，形成一个金字塔，这就是经典的&quot;自动化金字塔&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    L4[企业层 ERP&lt;br/&gt;经营管理] --&gt; L3[管理层 MES&lt;br/&gt;生产执行]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L2[控制层 SCADA/PLC&lt;br/&gt;过程监控]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L1[现场层 传感器/执行器&lt;br/&gt;实时数据]\">flowchart TB\n    L4[企业层 ERP&lt;br/&gt;经营管理] --&gt; L3[管理层 MES&lt;br/&gt;生产执行]\n    L3 --&gt; L2[控制层 SCADA/PLC&lt;br/&gt;过程监控]\n    L2 --&gt; L1[现场层 传感器/执行器&lt;br/&gt;实时数据]</pre><p>越往下，实时性要求越高、数据越原始、通信越频繁；越往上，实时性要求越低、数据越宏观、越偏向管理决策。工业互联网很大程度上就是要打通这座金字塔，让底层的现场数据能顺畅地流到顶层的经营决策中——而这正需要不同层级之间的网络能够互联互通。</p>\n<p>不同层级对网络的要求差异很大，我整理成表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型系统</th>\n<th>实时性要求</th>\n<th>数据特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现场层</td>\n<td>传感器、执行器</td>\n<td>极高（毫秒级）</td>\n<td>原始、高频、量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制层</td>\n<td>PLC、SCADA</td>\n<td>高（毫秒到秒）</td>\n<td>状态、控制指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理层</td>\n<td>MES</td>\n<td>中（秒级）</td>\n<td>工单、批次、质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业层</td>\n<td>ERP</td>\n<td>低（分钟级以上）</td>\n<td>订单、库存、财务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解了这个金字塔，你就明白为什么工业网络不是&quot;一种网络&quot;，而是一组针对不同层级、不同实时性需求的网络技术的集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用你自己的话解释&quot;实时&quot;和&quot;确定性&quot;的区别，并举一个生活中的例子说明&quot;准时比快更重要&quot;。</li>\n<li>抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = t_{\\max} - t_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量的是什么？为什么工业控制特别在意抖动小，而不只是平均延迟低？</li>\n<li>自动化金字塔有四层。请你把下面的任务放到对应层级：(a) 读取某传感器的瞬时压力；(b) 安排明天生产 500 件产品的工单；(c) 统计本季度的原材料采购成本；(d) 控制阀门在 5 毫秒内关闭。</li>\n<li>思考题：标准以太网是&quot;尽力而为&quot;的。请你想想，如果两台设备同时往网络上发数据会发生什么？这为什么对工业控制是个问题？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>想加深对&quot;确定性&quot;的理解，我推荐你搜索&quot;实时操作系统（RTOS）&quot;这个概念，看看软件层面是怎么保证任务准时执行的——它和网络层面的确定性追求是相通的。</p>\n<p>如果你想动手，可以找一个免费的 Modbus 模拟器软件玩一玩，亲手发一条读取寄存器的指令、看看返回的数据，会比读十页文档更有感觉。Modbus 是最古老、最简单的工业协议之一，是绝佳的入门对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们建立了工业网络的基本世界观：它的灵魂是确定性，衡量它的是实时性、可靠性、确定性三个指标，组织它的是从现场层到企业层的自动化金字塔。我们也理解了为什么&quot;尽力而为&quot;的普通以太网撑不起工业控制的重任。</p>\n<p>带着这个金字塔继续往下读。下一节我们会看到，工程师们是如何用现场总线和时间敏感网络（TSN），一步步把&quot;不确定&quot;的以太网改造成工厂可以信赖的&quot;准时班车&quot;的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工业网络基础","id":"工业网络基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘与云协同","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/architecture-and-system/edge-cloud-collaboration"},"next":{"title":"现场总线与时间敏感网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols/fieldbus-and-tsn"}}